{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-09_end","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-08","title":"瘋人的辯護","storyCode":"16-9","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"b06cbcabd4b537509d99efc3421221748a6175d7c7b877b35fd0752695c13792","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"精神失常的礦工堅信他必須殺死這裡的村民，就像搶奪車輛時，他必須殺死自己的孩子。而在一場襲捲整個村莊的大火中，雷爾金以為自己的惡夢成真了。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g14_ursusvillage"},{"type":"narration","text":"烏薩斯的深秋，夜晚的氣溫驟降。寒風襲捲，吹得枝椏上的積雪紛紛飄落。\n空地上，人群早已散去，遠處錯落的矮屋也看不到一戶亮燈。\n空地中央的火堆裡，燒焦的木柴上依然殘存著一絲火焰，火苗被北風一遍遍撕扯，延續著最後的喘息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一根粗壯的木柴被丟進了火堆中，揚起的火星在空中飄散。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了我們的行蹤。"},{"type":"narration","text":"乾燥的木柴躺在焦炭中，漸漸被燻黑、變形，隨後被突然躥起的火焰完全吞沒。\n火光映照在虛弱的感染者的面龐上，他卻感受不到一絲溫暖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人。這裡的……所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有把他們也抹去……就像抹去加尼亞……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們才不必……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必喪失道德，不必背棄純潔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必玷汙靈魂。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他很痛，宛如鑽心之痛，像被針尖穿透。\n他很冷，冷得無法停止顫抖，像掉入冰凍的湖泊。\n他必須讓自己暖和起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一根，兩根，三根。\n一捆，兩捆，三捆。\n原本微弱的火苗從木頭的縫隙中鑽出，變成一隻熾熱的魔鬼，它的火舌幾乎快碰觸到點火者的身體。\n瘦弱的礦工拾起一根燃燒的木棍，朝著寂靜的房屋走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_newiceforest_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"噔，噠。噔，噠。\n有節奏的腳步聲，一輕一重，一強一弱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睡著……睡著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全都睡著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不知道自己會面臨怎樣的困境，會面對怎樣的審判。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫助和包藏感染者，然後出賣他們。無知的人，溫馴如馱獸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會幫助你們，我能幫助你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……因為我願意默想……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並分擔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的痛苦。"},{"type":"narration","text":"狂徒手握恐懼的火把，但零星的火焰已經不能抑制他的寒冷。\n他感到冰冷刺骨。寒氣來自礦石病，來自寒風，來自烏薩斯。\n他需要更多的溫暖。\n突然間，一大堆乾草出現在他的視野中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一場火。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他拋下火把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一場淨化——"},{"type":"narration","text":"火舌喚醒了所有枯萎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一次拯救！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他從未如此清晰地感覺到，自己活著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"narration","text":"腦內持續地嗡鳴，雷爾金努力想從惡夢中搶回一絲感知與理智。\n五感正在一點點恢復，哀嚎聲卻仍未遠去，反而越來越近。\n他強撐著身體，步履蹣跚地朝帳篷外走去，想要呼吸一口新鮮的空氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"灼熱的空氣撲面而來，身上的冷汗幾乎立刻被蒸發。\n一瞬間，所有的感覺全部回到了體內，刺激著雷爾金的身體。\n這裡不是夢境，這裡是現實。惡夢中的場景在現實中被延續。\n四處都是逃竄的人群，那些曾為人們提供庇護的房屋，現在正被火焰摧枯拉朽地吞沒。\n升騰的濃煙裡，那些焦苦絕望的氣息如同魔爪死死扼住每個人的喉嚨，在這種威壓之下，人類渺小如蟻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡……發生了什麼事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，火是突然間冒出來的。這麼大的火勢我們根本沒辦法撲滅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在能做的只有疏散大家！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，我們換來的糧食都還在裡面，我得進去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡還有功夫管這種事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去把所有人叫醒！讓所有人都逃去村子外面！快，快走！"},{"type":"narration","text":"然而火場裡的人群並沒有因為雷爾金的話變得更有秩序，恐懼在肆無忌憚地蔓延。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_30"},{"type":"narration","text":"他從未……\n死去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這樣不對……我贏了，我殺死了他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能救所有人……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別喬克，你怎麼在這裡？快點去安全的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，我、我……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽不懂我的話嗎？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金想甩開別喬克的手，但小女孩用盡了全身力氣拉住了他的手臂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，奶奶，她、她，不見了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼……？你不是一直跟她在一起嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"口吃的女孩雙手並用，試圖解釋發生了什麼，但她恐懼的表情已經說明了一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尼克托！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你繼續疏散大家，我跟別喬克去找娜迦夫人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金和別喬克穿梭在火場之中。兩側房屋燒燎，稍不注意，他們的衣服就會被火點燃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶……嗚，嗚，奶奶！"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金也想大聲呼喊，無力感卻在他的心中不斷堆疊，堵住了他的咽喉，讓他難以發聲、難以呼吸。\n他很清楚，如此猛烈的大火對一個行動困難的老者來說代表著什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老、老師，我……您……唔……唔！"},{"type":"narration","text":"冒著黑煙的十字路口，別喬克摀住嘴指了指自己，又指了指雷爾金，最後指向了路的分岔處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不行……別喬克，你不能和我分開行動……你聽我說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師！"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩此刻漲紅著臉，豆大的淚珠從她的雙眸中湧出。她將雙手交握，做出一種奇異的、虔誠的祈禱模樣。\n她不祈求皇帝，不祈求聖愚。她祈求雷爾金的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_29"},{"type":"narration","text":"愚蠢。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個黑影從兩人的眼前闖過，他一瘸一拐，步伐卻異常有力，彷彿被什麼吸引了一般。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"霍里？你要去哪裡？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"佝僂的背影並沒有理會雷爾金的呼喊，只是一步步朝著道路盡頭的火海走去。\n四面八方的火光驅散了他的影子，猶如傳聞中走向刑場的聖愚一樣，像是要準備迎接火焰的沐浴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別喬克，等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至此，我犯下殺戮的罪過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不為食物，不為潔淨的水，不為溫暖的房屋。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他念誦著，步履不停，推開一扇燃燒的房門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i23"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金的視線越過霍里，即便火光持續灼燒著他的雙眼，也無法阻止他看見房屋裡的一切——\n火焰猙獰翻騰，焦黑的梁柱搖搖晃晃，劈啪聲如垂死者斷斷續續的呻吟。\n然而，一位老婦卻端坐在火焰間的方寸之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的婦人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"她坐在僅剩的椅子上，木然無聲，火舌與她只有咫尺距離，卻彷彿被一道無形的牆隔絕開來。\n她周身纖塵不染，連頭髮也一絲不亂。她雙眼微閉，又彷彿看著一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至此，我潔淨了他們的靈魂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
